{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42247","headline":"和萧郎中午日见寄 · 徐铉","name":"和萧郎中午日见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"细雨轻风采药时，褰帘隐几更何爲。\n岂知泽畔纫兰客，来赴城中角黍期。\n多罪静思如剉蘖，赦书才听似含饴。\n谢公制胜常闲暇，愿接西州敌手棊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}